WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.620
Students who tried to be served at these lunch counters; they would be turned down and told to leave the stores.

2
00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:18.000
And there were times when they didn’t leave, and they would go to jail.

3
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:25.190
But, this was at the beginning of some of the unpleasantness that happened in the late fifties and sixties.
